@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-50 - Process Return Request

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Purchases / Returns UI" as FE
control "ReturnsController" as API
control "ReturnsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: returnRequests, bills" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-50
FE -> API: PATCH /returns/:id/status
API -> Service: Execute Process Return Request
Service -> DB: Read/write returnRequests, bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Return status = PROCESSING

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Return status = APPROVED
Post: Return status = PROCESSING
Main flow:
1. Admin chọn return status APPROVED
2. Admin bấm Process
3. System gọi API PATCH /returns/:id/status { status: PROCESSING }
4. System cập nhật status
5. Có thể hoàn stock nếu là RETURN/EXCHANGE
end note
@enduml
